#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Ivolt yeziQinisekiso"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Ifayile yesiTshixo seVolt"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored credentials. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write (the same applies to credential files); the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored credentials must be entered again."
msgstr "Umendo opheleleyo kwisitshixo see-32-byte esifihla iziqinisekiso ezigciniweyo. Zenzele sona, ngaphandle kwe-web root, sifundeke kuphela yi-web server nomsebenzisi we-poller, kwisikhombisi ekunokubhala kuso i-root naloo msebenzisi kuphela (okufanayo kuyasebenza kwiifayile zeziqinisekiso); i-plugin ayize iyenze okanye iyibhale. Yenzele ikopi yokugcina kunye ne-database: ngaphandle kwayo, iziqinisekiso ezigciniweyo kufuneka zifakwe kwakhona."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential File Directory"
msgstr "IsiKhombisi seFayile yesiQinisekiso"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the directory that holds credential files. An account can read its credential from a file only inside it, never the vault key file. Empty, the default, refuses credential files. Cloud Admin chooses the file, so keep only cloud credentials here."
msgstr "Umendo opheleleyo kwisikhombisi esigcina iifayile zeziqinisekiso. Iakhawunti inokufunda isiqinisekiso sayo kwifayile ekuso kuphela, ingaze ibe yifayile yesitshixo sevolt. Ukuba ayinanto, okusisiseko, iyazala iifayile zeziqinisekiso. Umlawuli we-Cloud ukhetha ifayile, ngoko gcina iziqinisekiso ze-cloud kuphela apha."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Umqokeleli"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Uhlahlo-lwabiwo lweXesha loMqokeleli"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new work. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished accounts resume on the next run."
msgstr "Imizuzwana enokuchithwa luhambo olunye lomqokeleli phambi kokuba luyeke ukuqala umsebenzi omtsha. Yigcine ngaphantsi kwethuba le-poller; iiakhawunti ezingagqitywanga ziyaqhubeka kuhambo olulandelayo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina iiTheyibhile ze-Plugin xa uKhupha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its accounts, encrypted credentials, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Cloud resources are never touched either way."
msgstr "Xa kukhethiwe, ukukhupha i-plugin kugcina iiakhawunti zayo, iziqinisekiso ezifihliweyo, ne-cache. Yisuse ukuze ukukhupha kuzilahle. Izibonelelo ze-Cloud azize zichukunyiswe nangayiphi na indlela."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "Not verified yet."
msgstr "Ayikaqinisekiswa okwangoku."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works and has the permissions this account needs."
msgstr "Isiqinisekiso siyasebenza kwaye sinazo iimvume ezifunwa yile akhawunti."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider rejected the credential. It may be wrong, expired, or revoked."
msgstr "Umboneleli usikhabile isiqinisekiso. Kusenokwenzeka ukuba asichanekanga, siphelelwe lixesha, okanye sirhoxisiwe."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works but lacks a permission this account needs."
msgstr "Isiqinisekiso siyasebenza kodwa siswele imvume efunwa yile akhawunti."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider could not be reached. Check the network path and outbound policy from the poller."
msgstr "Umboneleli akakwazanga ukufikelelwa. Jonga umendo womnatha nomgaqo-nkqubo ophumayo ukusuka kwi-poller."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider is throttling requests. Try again later."
msgstr "Umboneleli uyazinciphisa izicelo. Zama kwakhona kamva."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider sent a response the plugin could not read."
msgstr "Umboneleli uthumele impendulo engakwazanga ukufundwa yi-plugin."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The account or its credential is not configured correctly."
msgstr "Iakhawunti okanye isiqinisekiso sayo asiqwalaselwanga ngokuchanekileyo."

